WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.713
It was a rainy day.

2
00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:24.595
"It's a perfect day for cleaning," Flopsy said.

3
00:00:24.596 --> 00:00:30.358
Mopsy frowned. "Ugh," she said.

4
00:00:30.358 --> 00:00:41.241
"Cleaning is not fun," Cotton-tail said.

5
00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:50.398
Flopsy gave dusters to her sisters.

6
00:00:50.398 --> 00:00:55.618
She got a broom.

7
00:00:55.619 --> 00:01:02.340
The three bunnies began to clean.

8
00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:09.721
Outside, Tommy Brock was looking for a new home.

9
00:01:09.722 --> 00:01:18.682
The badger was wet and cold.

10
00:01:18.683 --> 00:01:23.144
Then he spotted a den.

11
00:01:23.144 --> 00:01:27.480
"That den looks clean and dry," Tommy thought.

12
00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:33.250
"I will move in!"

13
00:01:33.251 --> 00:01:36.714
Flopsy began scrubbing dishes.

14
00:01:36.715 --> 00:01:40.829
Mopsy and Cotton-tail were still dusting.

15
00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.331
Then the rain stopped.

16
00:01:44.331 --> 00:01:47.508
The sun came out.

17
00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:50.304
Mopsy looked at Cotton-tail.

18
00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:53.057
Cotton-tail looked at Mopsy.

19
00:01:53.058 --> 00:02:02.894
"Let's go outside!" Mopsy whispered.

20
00:02:02.895 --> 00:02:19.529
The two little rabbits sneaked outside.

21
00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:24.348
They hopped away fast down the lane.

22
00:02:24.349 --> 00:02:28.608
"It's so quiet," Flopsy thought.

23
00:02:28.609 --> 00:02:32.688
She turned around.

24
00:02:32.689 --> 00:02:45.665
"Mopsy?" she called. "Cotton-tail?"

25
00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:52.315
Tommy dragged his things into the den.

26
00:02:52.316 --> 00:03:01.177
"Whew!" he said. "That was hard work.

27
00:03:01.178 --> 00:03:03.862
Now I need some food."

28
00:03:03.863 --> 00:03:10.697
Just then two bunnies hopped by . . .
